              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu namea ana ma Isilaeli, Mũndũ o na wĩva wenyu ndakaye nthakame, o na mũeni o na wĩva ũla wĩkalaa ũeni kwenyu ndakaye nthakame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũndũ o na wĩva wa ana ma Isilaeli, o na wa aeni ala mekalaa ũeni kwoo, ũla wĩũaa nyamũ o na yĩva akĩsyĩma kana nyũnyi o na yĩva ĩla ĩtonya kũĩwa; akete nthakame yayo, na kũmĩvw’ĩka na mũthanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
