              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ thayũ wa mĩĩ yonthe, nthakame yayo nĩ ũndũ ũmwe na thayũ wayo: nũndũ wa ũu namea ana ma Isilaeli, Mũtikaye nthakame ya nyama o na yĩva yonthe, nũndũ thayũ wa mĩĩ yonthe nĩ nthakame yayo: o ũla wĩmĩya akavetwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
